            </note>
            <note corresp="#d595-f2" n="73" xml:id="d595-f2-content">
                <p>Member of the Joint Brazil–United States Military Commission.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d595-f3" n="74" xml:id="d595-f3-content">
                <p>Another member of the Commission.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d595-f4" n="75" xml:id="d595-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed; it reported student unrest, dissatisfaction with the Brazilian
                    Expeditionary Force, and suspicion of the United States (832.00/4502).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
